                ----
				This extension contains only the msd bootcode, rpiboot can be used to flash
				recovery images or secure boot files.
				
				See https://github.com/raspberrypi/usbboot

				To use this to flash a recovery images, you need to use git.

				git clone --depth=1 https://github.com/raspberrypi/usbboot  
				cd usbboot
				git submodule init
				git submodule update
				rpiboot -d recovery    (or recovery5 for a pi5)

				Then Connect your pi with the approprirate boot mode jumper setting
				See https://github.com/raspberrypi/usbboot/Readme.md

